seq:CM-1-1-1-1-4--CM-1-1-2--forecast-version a core:ScopedSequence ;
    dcterms:source <urn:epm:issue:205:comment:6116668059> ;
    skos:definition "For a given forecast cycle and version, Publish Forecast and Generate Component Level Forecast Plan (CM-1-1-1-1-4) publishes and makes the approved forecast available before Regional Optimization (CM-1-1-2) uses that version as an approved planning input. Other optimization work may proceed independently; subsequent forecast revisions can prompt another optimization run."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Publish Forecast and Generate Component Level Forecast Plan before Regional Optimization, per forecast version"@en ;
