    dcterms:source <urn:epm:issue:205:comment:6116668059> ;
    skos:definition "For each replenishment requirement or approved revision, Manage Inventory Replenishment (CM-1-1-3-7-9) establishes and releases the required product, quantity, destination, and timing before Physical Distribution Scheduling (CM-1-1-3-6) schedules the corresponding movement. Scheduling constraints may feed back into a revised replenishment requirement."@en ;
