    skos:definition "For each scheduling horizon, Refinery Planning and Optimization (CM-1-1-4) makes the applicable approved plan or authorized revision available before Production Scheduling (CM-1-1-7-2) releases the corresponding executable schedule. Scheduling preparation may overlap planning, and feasibility feedback may trigger plan revisions."@en ;
