    dcterms:source <urn:epm:issue:205:comment:6116668059> ;
    skos:definition "For each plan-selection decision that uses scenario analysis, Perform Scenario Analysis (CM-1-1-4-7-8) provides the relevant evaluated alternatives before the corresponding production plan is selected and approved within Refinery Planning and Optimization (CM-1-1-4). This is an internal step-level sequence, not a sequence preceding the start of the parent process."@en ;
