    skos:definition "Where ISO/power-pool settlement includes items arising from a captured transmission arrangement, initial capture of the relevant arrangement under Capture Transmission Deals (CM-1-2-1-3-11) precedes validation of those items under Settle ISO/Power Pools (CM-1-2-4-1-7). Other settlement activities may proceed independently."@en ;
