    skos:definition "Capture Physical Trades (CM-1-2-1-3-3) records the agreed commercial terms and makes the required trade data available to Confirmations Management (CM-1-2-2-2) for prompt counterparty confirmation. Initial capture precedes submission for confirmation; discrepancies may require controlled correction of the captured record."@en ;
