    skos:definition "For each physical delivery or settlement period, Actualizations (CM-1-2-3-1) records and validates the relevant actual quantities and movement facts before Settlements (CM-1-2-4-1) uses those inputs to calculate or validate the corresponding charges. Settlement preparation and contractually permitted provisional billing may proceed before every input is final; subsequent corrections are handled through controlled true-ups."@en ;
